WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,600
Shen Xi was the only person who secretly treated her well during Yuanzhu's twenty years of hard life.

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:08,400
Her family was poor, but they always gave her fried beans and even eggs from between her teeth.

3
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,400
Brother Tian, eat quickly and don’t let anyone see you.

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:14,140
The only light in the life of the circle master

5
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:20,040
Shen Xi, why are you here?

6
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:26,000
I heard that you broke up with the old Qin family and moved here to live, and I was worried.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:31,100
Brother Tian, take what I secretly hid and I’ll get you some in two days.

8
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:35,740
Love me

9
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:37,740
I have to go back. If it's too late, my mother will find out.

10
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:46,060
I remember this sacrifice of life and death

11
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:50,140
Shen Xi, it’s me who will take care of you from now on

12
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:59,690
Not much variety
